{"title":"Snow Yeti","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 55 Yeti that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/snow-yeti\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/snow-yeti?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/snow-yeti?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/snow-yeti?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>3</td><td>in the wilds around 495, -924</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/snow-yeti\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>3</td><td>in the wilds around 478, -925</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"snow-yeti\" data-map-level=\"56\">Show level 56 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-3863.5px,600.5px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/15/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/15/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:-512px\"><i style=\"left:3783.7px;top:-633.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:3869.4px;top:-566.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:3953.1px;top:-584.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:3929.8px;top:-605.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:3773.1px;top:-639.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:3871.8px;top:-573.5px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 484, -921 <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"snow-yeti\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Yeti: <a href=\"#/monster/yeti\">Yeti</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager\">Yeti Ravager</a> <span class=\"muted\">(60)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/yeti-matriarch\">Yeti Matriarch</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/9e13c235387191770133.svg\" alt=\"Snow Yeti\"></div><h3>Snow Yeti</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>56</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 55)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Yeti</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>389</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>35.3</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,800</td></tr>\n      <tr><t